OL,3,GNEWSATrespass incidents cause almost
OL,4,A10,000 minutes of delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrespass incidents caused almost 10,000
OL,7,Fminutes of delays to South Western
OL,8,FRailway (SWR) services for the 2025/26
OL,9,Fperiod.
OL,11,FData released by Network Rail and
OL,12,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) shows
OL,13,Fthat 9,437 minutes worth of delays were
OL,14,Fcaused, equivalent to about six and a
OL,15,Fhalf days.
OL,17,FAcross England, trespass, cable theft
OL,18,Fand obstruction caused more than 3,300
OL,19,Fhours of delays during the same period,
OL,20,Fmaking it one of the railway's biggest
OL,21,Fcauses of disruption, with a
OL,22,Fsignificant impact on customers.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
