OL,3,GNEWSATrespass incidents cause almost
OL,4,A10,000 minutes of delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe SWR network had the third-highest
OL,7,Frate of vandalism and obstruction
OL,8,Facross Network Rail's 14 routes,
OL,9,Fincluding deliberately placed items
OL,10,Fsuch as debris and other pieces of
OL,11,Ftrack on the railway.
